          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Copy Public Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "关闭后，Zeta 将不再连接此设备，设备上的对话仍会继续运行。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When off, Zeta doesn’t connect to this device. Conversations on it keep running there."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "暂无设备": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No Devices Yet"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "好": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "OK"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "环境": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Environment"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "会话正在别处运行，在那边退出后才能在这里接着": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This session is running elsewhere. Exit it there to continue here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "或发起一个新对话": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Or start a new conversation"
          }
