      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeta Couldn’t Start"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入私钥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import Private Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复使用 Zeta 密钥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Use Zeta’s Own Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入的私钥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Imported Private Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复使用 Zeta 密钥？": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch back to Zeta’s own key?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "恢复": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Switch Back"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将从此设备移除已导入的私钥，之后改用 Zeta 自带密钥登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The imported private key is deleted from this device, and Zeta signs in with its own key again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "从文件选取": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choose File"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "私钥": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Private Key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "粘贴或选取 OpenSSH、PEM 格式的私钥文件（例如 ~/.ssh/id_ed25519），请勿选择 .pub 公钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Paste or choose an OpenSSH or PEM private key file (such as ~/.ssh/id_ed25519), not a .pub public key."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "无密码请留空": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Leave empty if none"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "密码": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passphrase"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入后会移除密码并将私钥存入本机钥匙串，之后不再提示输入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After import, the key is stored in this device’s keychain without the passphrase, so you won’t be asked again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "导入": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Import"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Zeta 当前使用已导入的私钥登录，上方为其对应公钥。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Zeta signs in with the imported private key; its public key is shown above."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "将这一行添加到目标设备的 ~/.ssh/authorized_keys，Zeta 方可登录。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Add this line to ~/.ssh/authorized_keys on your device so Zeta can sign in."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "私钥仅保存在本机钥匙串中。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The private key stays in this device’s keychain."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "该文件不是有效的私钥格式": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "This file doesn’t look like a private key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "类型": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Type"
