    "用于在此设备发起新对话。使用中转时，默认模型保存在中转设置中；对话内切换的选项仅对当前对话生效。思考强度按模型分别保存。上下文窗口指单次会话的 token 上限，自动压缩以此为基准；若超过模型自身上限，则以模型上限为准。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Used for new conversations on this device. With a relay, the default model is saved in the relay settings. Choices made in a conversation apply only there. Thinking effort is stored per model. The context window is the most tokens a session uses; auto-compact goes by it, or by the model's own window if that is smaller."
          }
        }
      }
    },
